tration Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__size-large HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__illustration" role="img" aria-label="Abstract node-column data visualization showing interconnected organic shapes in cream and dark gray, resembling a data flow or network structure"></div><h1 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-display-1-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__headline"><span class="HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__headlineLeft">Navigating AI in higher</span><span class="HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__join"> </span><span class="HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__headlineRight">education together</span></h1><div class="HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__body"><p class="HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__subheadline text-body-large-2">Claude helps universities and colleges advance research, support teaching and learning, and run operations and student support systems more effectively.</p><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup HeroIllustrationStagger-module-scss-module__x8J4xq__ctas"><a href="/contact-sales/education-plan" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-main text-body-2" data-cta-position="heroIllustrationStagger" data-cta-url="/contact-sales/education-plan">Contact our Education team</a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="logoWall" data-section="logoWall" data-cta-section="logoWall" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__wrapper theme-main SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__spacingTopXsmall SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__spacingBottomSmall"><div class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__borderTop"></div><div data-wf-threshold="large" class="container"><div class="LogoWall-modu