</div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-2">From drafting policy and onboarding communications to reviewing transcripts and building budgets, Claude helps administrative teams transform the way they work without losing quality. Institutions can deploy Claude across departments with the security and compliance controls they need.</p></div></div></div></div></div><aside class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__rails" aria-label="Side notes"><div class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__rail AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__railLeft" data-aside-rail="left"><div class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__slider" role="group" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Carousel"><div class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__deck"><div class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__slide AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__slideActive" style="--aside-offset:0;--aside-distance:0"><article class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__card MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__sideCard" data-marginalia-card="prompt" data-theme="accent"><div class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__header"><p class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__heading text-caption">How can I help?</p></div><div class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__content"><p class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__text MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__prompt text-caption">I&#x27;m writing an essay on the ethical implications of predictive policing. After each paragraph I write, give me feedback on 1) clarity, 2) evidence quality, 3) whether my argument actually follows from the evidence.</p><div class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__promptAction"><a href="https://claude.ai/new?q=I%27m+writing+an+essay+on+the+ethical+implications+of+predictive+policing.+After+each+paragraph+I+write%2C+give+me+feedback+on+1%29+clarity%2C+2%29+evidence+quality%2C+3%29+whether+my+argument+actually+follows+from+the+evidence." class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-brand Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__hasLeadingIcon text-caption MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__cta MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__ctaIcon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="aside" data-cta-url="https://claude.ai/new?q=I%27m+writing+an+essay+on+the+ethical+implications+of+predictive+policing.+After+each+paragraph+I+write%2C+give+me+feedback+on+1%29+clarity%2C+2%29+evidence+quality%2C+3%29+whether+my+argument+actually+follows+from+the+evidence."><span class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__icon"><div class="_base-module-scss-module__SsgDWW__wrapper" style="width:20px;height:20px"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="_base-module-scss-module__SsgDWW__vector" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3C10.1326 3.00003 10.2598 3.05274 10.3535 3.14648L15.3536 8.14648C15.5486 8.34174 15.5487 8.6583 15.3536 8.85352C15.1583 9.04873 14.8418 9.04863 14.6465 8.85352L10.5 4.70703V16.5C10.5 16.7761 10.2761 16.9999 10 17C9.72389 17 9.50003 16.7761 9.50003 16.5V4.70703L5.35353 8.85352C5.15827 9.04862 4.84172 9.04868 4.6465 8.85352C4.45128 8.6583 4.45138 8.34176 4.6465 8.14648L9.64651 3.14648L9.72268 3.08398C9.8042 3.02967 9.90062 3 10 3Z"></path></svg></div></span>Ask Claude<span class="sr-only" lang="en" data-export-skip=""> (opens in new tab)</span></a></div></div></article></div><div class="AsideRails-module-scss-module__sFf8jW__slide" style="--aside-offset:1;--aside-distance:1" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><article class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__card MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__sideCard" data-marginalia-card="prompt" data-theme="accent"><div class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__header"><p class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__heading text-caption">How can I help?</p></div><div class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__content"><p class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__text MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__prompt text-caption">Review this grant proposal draft and suggest stronger evidence for the methodology section. I&#x27;m studying the effect of bilingual education on long-term literacy outcomes in immigrant communities.</p><div class="MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__promptAction"><a href="https://claude.ai/new?q=Review+this+grant+proposal+draft+and+suggest+stronger+evidence+for+the+methodology+section.+I%27m+studying+the+effect+of+bilingual+education+on+long-term+literacy+outcomes+in+immigrant+communities." class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-brand Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__hasLeadingIcon text-caption MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__cta MarginaliaCard-module-scss-module__b9VA3W__ctaIcon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position="aside" data-cta-url="https://claude.ai/new?q=Review+this+grant+proposal+draft+and+suggest+stronger+evidence+for+the+methodology+section.+I%27m+studying+the+effect+of+bilingual+education+on+long-term+literacy+outcomes+in+immigrant+communities."><span class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__icon"><div class="_base-module-scss-module__SsgDWW__wrapper" style="width:20px;height:20px"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="_base-module-scss-module__SsgDWW__vector" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3C10.1326 3.00003 10.2598 3.05274 10.3535 3.14648L15.3536 8.14648C15.5486 8.34174 15.5487 8.6583 15.3536 8.85352C15.1583 9.04873 14.8418 9.04863 14.6465 8.85352L10.5 4.70703V16.5C10.5 16.7761 10.2761 16.9999 10 17C9.72389 17 9.50003 16.7761 9.50003 16.5V4.70703