13 12.2411 7.50432L11.2333 4.94571C10.6259 3.40439 8.88406 2.6471 7.3426 3.25429C5.80118 3.86161 5.04399 5.60345 5.65118 7.14494L6.659 9.70355C6.76021 9.96048 6.6337 10.2508 6.37677 10.352C6.11988 10.4531 5.82952 10.3266 5.72833 10.0698L4.7205 7.51116C3.91111 5.45581 4.92107 3.13323 6.97639 2.32362L7.16975 2.25331Z" /></svg></span>Anthropic Academy</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="featureList" data-section="featureList" data-cta-section="featureList" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__wrapper theme-accent SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__spacingTopLarge SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__spacingBottomLarge"><div class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__borderTop"></div><div data-wf-width="full" class="container"><div class="grid-12"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__inner FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__fullWidth" style="--slot-min-rem:1"><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__introBlock grid-12 IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__split FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__intro" style="--intro-headline-width:20ch"><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__splitStart"><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__splitHead"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__base Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__size-large IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__pictogram" role="img" aria-label="Beige and black shield design with vertical striped pattern, featuring a protective emblem or badge icon"></div><h2 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-3-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__heading IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headline" style="--word-stagger:0.028571428571428574s" aria-label="Our commitment to responsible AI in higher education"><span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:0" aria-hidden="true">Our</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:1" aria-hidden="true">commitment</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:2" aria-hidden="true">to</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:3" aria-hidden="true">responsible</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:4" aria-hidden="true">AI</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:5" aria-hidden="true">in</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:6" aria-hidden="true">higher</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:7" aria-hidden="true">education</span></h2></div></div><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__splitEnd"><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__subheadlineAndCtas" style="--reveal-y:10px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><p class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__subheadline text-body-1" style="--reveal-index:0">At Anthropic, we believe AI has the power to fundamentally transform education for the better, but only if educators and higher education institutions lead the charge. We developed Claude with powerful safeguards to ensure it remains a beneficial tool for students, faculty, and administrators.</p></div></div></div><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__list FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__horizontal FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__autofit FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__noWidow FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__cols3" style="--reveal-y:20px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:0"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.2705 3.0498C11.1054 1.5437 15.4369 3.42942 16.9473 7.26367C18.4585 11.1003 16.5729 15.4359 12.7363 16.9473C8.89982 18.4583 4.56416 16.5736 3.05272 12.7373C1.54288 8.90435 3.42282 4.57201 7.25194 3.05663C7.25547 3.05522 7.25914 3.05413 7.26269 3.05273C7.26523 3.05172 7.26795 3.05079 7.2705 3.0498ZM8.64159 14.5283C8.05764 14.958 7.56418 15.4198 7.17772 15.8896C8.21355 16.3858 9.37633 16.6096 10.5508 16.5098C10.2224 16.2862 9.89754 16.0029 9.58202 15.6748C9.26312 15.3432 8.94744 14.9583 8.64159 14.5283ZM13.1572 12.5351C12.5305 12.6659 11.8818 12.8585 11.2275 13.1162C10.5729 13.3741 9.96666 13.6758 9.41894 14.0078C9.6946 14.3937 9.97385 14.7371 10.2539 15.0283C10.7036 15.4959 11.1332 15.8156 11.5117 15.9863C11.8879 16.1559 12.1765 16.1643 12.3935 16.0791C12.6107 15.9936 12.8179 15.7903 12.9775 15.4092C13.1379 15.0262 13.2342 14.4991 13.2441 13.8506C13.2503 13.4466 13.2187 13.0053 13.1572 12.5351ZM3.63768 8.51855C3.34594 9.76629 3.4167 11.1121 3.92186 12.3945C4.42675 13.6762 5.29203 14.7083 6.35546 15.4219C6.82009 14.8304 7.4201 14.2628 8.12694 13.748C7.6691 12.9972 7.2458 12.1466 6.88378 11.2275C6.52163 10.3082 6.25055 9.397 6.07323 8.53515C5.20566 8.64053 4.38055 8.63422 3.63768 8.51855ZM16.081 12.3828C15.4777 12.3027 14.8015 12.3016 14.081 12.3857C14.1506 12.9087 14.1838 13.4053 14.1767 13.8652C14.1698 14.3208 14.124 14.75 14.0361 15.1377C14.9636 14.4096 15.6617 13.4524 16.081 12.3828ZM11.0947 6.7705C10.4885 7.14026 9.82394 7.47239 9.11425 7.75195C8.40436 8.03157 7.69176 8.2418 6.99608 8.38476C7.16147 9.17591 7.41289 10.0225 7.75292 10.8857C8.09272 11.7483 8.48601 12.5376 8.90429 13.2285C9.51056 12.8587 10.176 12.5276 10.8857 12.248C11.5954 11.9685 12.3075 11.7572 13.0029 11.6143C12.8376 10.8236 12.5869 9.97794 12.2471 9.11523C11.907 8.25206 11.5133 7.46188 11.0947 6.7705ZM13.6426 4.57714C13.178 5.16855 12.5788 5.73625 11.8721 6.25097C12.3302 7.00222 12.754 7.85307 13.1162 8.77245C13.4782 9.69152 13.7485 10.6024 13.9258 11.4639C14.7932 11.3584 15.6185 11.3649 16.3613 11.4805C16.6528 10.233 16.5841 8.88752 16.0791 7.60546C15.5738 6.32297 14.707 5.29067 13.6426 4.57714ZM5.9619 4.86327C5.03547 5.59096 4.33712 6.54756 3.91796 7.6162C4.52106 7.69641 5.19677 7.69821 5.91698 7.61425C5.84736 7.09104 5.81616 6.59385 5.82323 6.13378C5.83026 5.679 5.87418 5.25038 5.9619 4.86327ZM8.48827 4.01367C8.11174 3.8439 7.82256 3.83644 7.60546 3.92187C7.38849 4.0075 7.182 4.20998 7.02245 4.59081C6.86212 4.97369 6.76585 5.50006 6.75585 6.14843C6.74965 6.55226 6.78027 6.99382 6.84179 7.46386C7.46863 7.33317 8.11803 7.14252 8.77245 6.88476C9.42675 6.62702 10.0316 6.32305 10.5791 5.9912C10.3036 5.6057 10.0259 5.26167 9.74608 4.9707C9.29651 4.50322 8.8667 4.18435 8.48827 4.01367ZM12.8223 4.10937C11.7866 3.61351 10.6234 3.3904 9.44921 3.49023C9.77744 3.71355 10.1026 3.99633 10.418 4.32421C10.7368 4.65579 11.0526 5.04068 11.3584 5.4707C11.9424 5.04095 12.4358 4.57931 12.8223 4.10937Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Ensure equitable access</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">We partner with institutions to make AI-enhanced education accessible to all students, regardless of background.</p></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:1"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2C12.2091 2 14 3.79086 14 6V8H15.5C16.3284 8 17 8.67157 17 9.5V16.5C17 17.3284 16.3284 18 15.5 18H4.5C3.67157 18 3 17.3284 3 16.5V9.5C3 8.67157 3.67157 8 4.5 8H6V6C6 3.79086 7.79086 2 10 2ZM4.5 9C4.22386 9 4 9.22386 4 9.5V16.5C4 16.7761 4.22386 17 4.5 17H15.5C15.7761 17 16 16.7761 16 16.5V9.5C16 9.22386 15.7761 9 15.5 9H4.5ZM10 11C10.6904 11 11.25 11.5596 11.25 12.25C11.25 12.7277 10.9817 13.1421 10.5879 13.3525L11 15H9L9.41113 13.3525C9.01775 13.142 8.75 12.7274 8.75 12.25C8.75 11.5596 9.30964 11 10 11ZM10 3C8.34315 3 7 4.34315 7 6V8H13V6C13 4.34315 11.6569 3 10 3Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Protect privacy and  ensure security</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">We only use data to train our models when given permission, and we maintain security standards that meet your compliance needs.</p></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:2"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4C14.0285 4 16.6432 7.30578 17.6602 8.86621L17.7402 8.99902C18.0858 9.62459 18.0858 10.3754 17.7402 11.001L17.6602 11.1338C16.6432 12.6942 14.0285 16 10 16C6.22298 16 3.68865 13.0942 2.54883 11.4453L2.33985 11.1338C1.88802 10.4404 1.88802 9.55955 2.33985 8.86621L2.54883 8.55469C3.68865 6.90581 6.22298 4 10 4ZM10 5C6.74739 5 4.47588 7.53 3.38086 9.11035L3.17774 9.41211C2.94217 9.77359 2.94217 10.2264 3.17774 10.5879L3.38086 10.8896C4.47588 12.47 6.74739 15 10 15C13.4691 15 15.8223 12.1222 16.8223 10.5879L16.8994 10.4482C17.0321 10.1621 17.0321 9.83791 16.8994 9.55176L16.8223 9.41211C15.8223 7.87782 13.4691 5 10 5ZM10 7C11.6569 7 13 8.34315 13 10C13 11.6569 11.6569 13 10 13C8.34315 13 7 11.6569 7 10C7 8.34315 8.34315 7 10 7ZM10 8C8.89543 8 8 8.89543 8 10C8 11.1046 8.89543 12 10 12C11.1046 12 12 11.1046 12 10C12 8.89543 11.1046 8 10 8Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Provide transparency</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">We share what Claude can (and can’t) do honestly, empowering you to make informed decisions about how AI fits into your educational environment.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="featureList" data-section="featureList" data-cta-section="featureList" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__wrapper theme-main"><div class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__borderTop"></div><div data-wf-threshold="large" class="container"><div class="grid-12"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__inner FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__fullWidth"><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__introBlock FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__intro" style="--intro-headline-width:30ch"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__base Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__size-large IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__pictogram" role="img" aria-label="Architectural building facade illustration featuring three vertical beige columns with geometric design elements, ornate roof details, and dark decorative patterns representing a classical institutional or governmental structure."></div><h2 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-1-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__heading IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headline IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headlineBalance" style="--word-stagger:0.03333333333333333s" aria-label="Products and programs to support higher education"><span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:0" aria-hidden="true">Products</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:1" aria-hidden="true">and</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:2" aria-hidden="true">programs</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:3" aria-hidden="true">to</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:4" aria-hidden="true">support</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:5" aria-hidden="true">higher</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:6" aria-hidden="true">education</span></h2></div><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__list FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__horizontal FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctasNatural FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__cols3" style="--reveal-y:20px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:0"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.6318 4.01757C11.898 4.09032 12.055 4.36555 11.9824 4.63183L8.98242 15.6318C8.90966 15.8981 8.63449 16.0551 8.36816 15.9824C8.10193 15.9097 7.94495 15.6345 8.01758 15.3682L11.0176 4.36816C11.0904 4.102 11.3656 3.94497 11.6318 4.01757ZM13.124 6.17089C13.3059 5.96325 13.6213 5.9423 13.8291 6.12402L17.8291 9.62402L17.9014 9.70215C17.9647 9.78754 18 9.89182 18 10C18 10.1441 17.9375 10.281 17.8291 10.376L13.8291 13.876L13.7471 13.9346C13.5449 14.0498 13.2833 14.011 13.124 13.8291C12.9649 13.6472 12.9606 13.3824 13.1016 13.1973L13.1709 13.124L16.7412 10L13.1709 6.87597C12.9632 6.69411 12.9422 6.37866 13.124 6.17089ZM6.25293 6.06542C6.45509 5.95025 6.71675 5.98908 6.87598 6.17089C7.03513 6.35279 7.03933 6.6176 6.89844 6.80273L6.8291 6.87597L3.25879 10L6.8291 13.124C7.03682 13.3059 7.05771 13.6213 6.87598 13.8291C6.69413 14.0369 6.37869 14.0578 6.1709 13.876L2.1709 10.376L2.09863 10.2979C2.03528 10.2124 2 10.1082 2 10C2.00005 9.85591 2.06247 9.71893 2.1709 9.62402L6.1709 6.12402L6.25293 6.06542Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Claude Code</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">Write and debug research code directly in your terminal or IDE. Claude works through analysis scripts, data pipelines, and computational problems, while explaining its reasoning. For courses across disciplines, students get a collaborator to build understanding.</p></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctas"><a href="/product/claude-code" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small text-caption" data-cta-position="featureList" data-cta-url="/product/claude-code">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:1"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16.5 3.99998C17.3284 3.99998 18 4.67156 18 5.49998V14.5C18 15.3284 17.3284 16 16.5 16H3.5C2.67159 16 2.00002 15.3284 2 14.5V8.99998C2 8.72384 2.22386 8.49998 2.5 8.49998C2.77614 8.49998 3 8.72384 3 8.99998V14.5C3.00002 14.7761 3.22387 15 3.5 15H16.5C16.7761 15 17 14.7761 17 14.5V5.49998C17 5.22384 16.7761 4.99998 16.5 4.99998H14C13.7239 4.99998 13.5 4.77611 13.5 4.49998C13.5 4.22384 13.7239 3.99998 14 3.99998H16.5ZM8.09766 3.00975C8.36831 3.06389 8.54415 3.327 8.49023 3.59764L7.49023 8.59764C7.43608 8.86827 7.17297 9.04413 6.90234 8.99022C6.6317 8.93609 6.45587 8.67296 6.50977 8.40233L7.50977 3.40233C7.5639 3.13167 7.82701 2.95583 8.09766 3.00975ZM4.77246 3.55467C4.97954 3.44859 5.23963 3.49874 5.39062 3.68748C5.5415 3.8761 5.53341 4.14059 5.38477 4.31932L5.3125 4.39061L3.30078 5.99998L5.3125 7.60936C5.52811 7.78187 5.56312 8.09686 5.39062 8.31248C5.21812 8.52808 4.90312 8.56309 4.6875 8.39061L2.1875 6.39061L2.1084 6.31053C2.03899 6.223 2.00001 6.11385 2 5.99998C2 5.84811 2.06891 5.70424 2.1875 5.60936L4.6875 3.60936L4.77246 3.55467ZM9.60938 3.68748C9.76037 3.49874 10.0205 3.44859 10.2275 3.55467L10.3125 3.60936L12.8125 5.60936C12.9311 5.70424 13 5.84811 13 5.99998C13 6.11385 12.961 6.22301 12.8916 6.31053L12.8125 6.39061L10.3125 8.39061C10.0969 8.56309 9.78188 8.52808 9.60938 8.31248C9.43688 8.09686 9.47189 7.78187 9.6875 7.60936L11.6992 5.99998L9.6875 4.39061L9.61523 4.31932C9.46659 4.14059 9.4585 3.8761 9.60938 3.68748Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Claude Developer Platform</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">Build AI directly into your own research tools, course platforms, or campus systems. The Claude API gives faculty developers and university IT teams access to integrate Claude into custom applications and existing workflows. If the right tool for your research doesn’t exist yet, build it.</p></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctas"><a href="/platform/api" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small text-caption" data-cta-position="featureList" data-cta-url="/platform/api">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:2"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.95805 2.62963C9.93059 1.31901 12.0004 2.28458 11.6212 3.87184L10.6339 7.99983H15.0128C16.2451 7.99983 16.9518 9.4036 16.2179 10.3934L11.0421 17.3701C10.0695 18.6811 7.99932 17.7154 8.37895 16.1279L9.36626 11.9999H4.98731C3.75491 11.9999 3.04804 10.5961 3.78222 9.6063L8.95805 2.62963ZM10.6485 3.63941C10.7747 3.11048 10.085 2.78872 9.7608 3.22535L4.58496 10.202C4.34047 10.5319 4.5766 10.9999 4.98731 10.9999H10.0001C10.153 10.9999 10.2978 11.0703 10.3926 11.1903C10.4873 11.3104 10.5218 11.4674 10.4864 11.6161L9.35161 16.3603C9.22501 16.8895 9.91512 17.2114 10.2393 16.7744L15.4151 9.79771C15.6594 9.46779 15.4234 8.99984 15.0128 8.99984H10.0001C9.84699 8.99984 9.70229 8.92958 9.60747 8.80941C9.51288 8.68931 9.47819 8.53233 9.51372 8.38362L10.6485 3.63941Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Claude Cowork</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">Set up a recurring task once and Claude runs it on the schedule you choose: a weekly digest of papers in your field, summaries compiled from your notes, reminders drafted from your grant calendar. You set the rules. Cowork follows them.</p></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctas"><a href="/product/cowork" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small text-caption" data-cta-position="featureList" data-cta-url="/product/cowork">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:3"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.3125 2C13.6503 2 13.9752 2.13212 14.2168 2.36816L16.6113 4.70898L16.6992 4.80469C16.8926 5.03621 17 5.32937 17 5.63379V13.707C16.9998 14.421 16.421 14.9998 15.707 15H13V16.707C12.9998 17.421 12.421 17.9998 11.707 18H4.29297C3.62349 17.9998 3.07307 17.4909 3.00684 16.8389L3 16.707V6.29297C3.00023 5.57898 3.57898 5.00023 4.29297 5H7V3.29297C7.00023 2.57898 7.57898 2.00023 8.29297 2H13.3125ZM4.29297 6C4.13127 6.00023 4.00023 6.13127 4 6.29297V16.707L4.00586 16.7656C4.03314 16.8993 4.15133 16.9998 4.29297 17H11.707C11.8687 16.9998 11.9998 16.8687 12 16.707V15H8.29297C7.62349 14.9998 7.07307 14.4909 7.00684 13.8389L7 13.707V6H4.29297ZM8.29297 3C8.13127 3.00023 8.00023 3.13127 8 3.29297V13.707C8.00023 13.8687 8.13127 13.9998 8.29297 14H15.707C15.8687 13.9998 15.9998 13.8687 16 13.707V6.5H14C13.1716 6.5 12.5 5.82843 12.5 5V3H8.29297ZM13.5 5C13.5 5.27614 13.7239 5.5 14 5.5H15.9648C15.9595 5.48965 15.9558 5.47842 15.9492 5.46875L15.9121 5.42383L13.5176 3.08398C13.5121 3.07863 13.5058 3.07422 13.5 3.06934V5Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Claude for Word</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">Draft and revise academic writing without leaving Word. Claude works inside your document to help structure arguments, tighten methodology sections, and give feedback on grant proposals or manuscripts. Changes come in as tracked revisions you accept, reject, or adjust.</p></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctas"><a href="/claude-for-microsoft-365" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small text-caption" data-cta-position="featureList" data-cta-url="/claude-for-microsoft-365">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:4"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 1.5C11.1097 1.5 12.0758 2.10424 12.5947 3H14.5C15.3284 3 16 3.67157 16 4.5V16.5C16 17.3284 15.3284 18 14.5 18H5.5C4.67157 18 4 17.3284 4 16.5V4.5C4 3.67157 4.67157 3 5.5 3H7.40527C7.92423 2.10424 8.89028 1.5 10 1.5ZM5.5 4C5.22386 4 5 4.22386 5 4.5V16.5C5 16.7761 5.22386 17 5.5 17H14.5C14.7761 17 15 16.7761 15 16.5V4.5C15 4.22386 14.7761 4 14.5 4H12.958C12.9853 4.16263 13 4.32961 13 4.5V5.5C13 5.77614 12.7761 6 12.5 6H7.5C7.22386 6 7 5.77614 7 5.5V4.5C7 4.32961 7.0147 4.16263 7.04199 4H5.5ZM12.54 13.3037C12.6486 13.05 12.9425 12.9317 13.1963 13.04C13.45 13.1486 13.5683 13.4425 13.46 13.6963C13.1651 14.3853 12.589 15 11.7998 15C11.3132 14.9999 10.908 14.7663 10.5996 14.4258C10.2913 14.7661 9.88667 14.9999 9.40039 15C8.91365 15 8.50769 14.7665 8.19922 14.4258C7.89083 14.7661 7.48636 15 7 15C6.72386 15 6.5 14.7761 6.5 14.5C6.5 14.2239 6.72386 14 7 14C7.21245 14 7.51918 13.8199 7.74023 13.3037L7.77441 13.2373C7.86451 13.0913 8.02513 13 8.2002 13C8.40022 13.0001 8.58145 13.1198 8.66016 13.3037C8.88121 13.8198 9.18796 14 9.40039 14C9.61284 13.9998 9.9197 13.8197 10.1406 13.3037L10.1748 13.2373C10.2649 13.0915 10.4248 13.0001 10.5996 13C10.7997 13 10.9808 13.1198 11.0596 13.3037C11.2806 13.8198 11.5874 13.9999 11.7998 14C12.0122 14 12.319 13.8198 12.54 13.3037ZM12.54 9.30371C12.6486 9.05001 12.9425 8.93174 13.1963 9.04004C13.45 9.14863 13.5683 9.44253 13.46 9.69629C13.1651 10.3853 12.589 11 11.7998 11C11.3132 10.9999 10.908 10.7663 10.5996 10.4258C10.2913 10.7661 9.88667 10.9999 9.40039 11C8.91365 11 8.50769 10.7665 8.19922 10.4258C7.89083 10.7661 7.48636 11 7 11C6.72386 11 6.5 10.7761 6.5 10.5C6.5 10.2239 6.72386 10 7 10C7.21245 10 7.51918 9.8199 7.74023 9.30371L7.77441 9.2373C7.86451 9.09126 8.02513 9 8.2002 9C8.40022 9.00008 8.58145 9.11981 8.66016 9.30371C8.88121 9.8198 9.18796 10 9.40039 10C9.61284 9.99978 9.9197 9.81969 10.1406 9.30371L10.1748 9.2373C10.2649 9.09147 10.4248 9.00014 10.5996 9C10.7997 9 10.9808 9.11975 11.0596 9.30371C11.2806 9.8198 11.5874 9.99989 11.7998 10C12.0122 10 12.319 9.81985 12.54 9.30371ZM10 2.5C8.89543 2.5 8 3.39543 8 4.5V5H12V4.5C12 3.39543 11.1046 2.5 10 2.5Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Claude for Research Labs</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">Connect Claude to the databases and files your research depends on. It holds context across a long conversation, helps you spot gaps in the evidence, and drafts sections grounded in what’s there.</p></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctas"><a href="/programs/team-plan-for-scientists" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small text-caption" data-cta-position="featureList" data-cta-url="/programs/team-plan-for-scientists">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__item" style="--reveal-index:5"><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemHeader"><span class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__eyebrow text-body-3"><svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemIcon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.4998 3C13.776 3 13.9998 3.22386 13.9998 3.5C13.9998 3.77614 13.776 4 13.4998 4H12.9998V8.34375L16.7967 13.8672C17.7087 15.1942 16.7585 17 15.1483 17H4.85132C3.24128 16.9998 2.29111 15.1941 3.20287 13.8672L6.99977 8.34375V4H6.49977C6.22374 3.99986 5.99977 3.77606 5.99977 3.5C5.99977 3.22394 6.22374 3.00014 6.49977 3H13.4998ZM4.02709 14.4336C3.5713 15.097 4.0464 15.9998 4.85132 16H15.1483C15.9534 16 16.4285 15.0971 15.9725 14.4336L14.9871 13H5.01245L4.02709 14.4336ZM7.99978 8.5C7.99978 8.60111 7.96916 8.69987 7.91189 8.7832L5.69996 12H14.2996L12.0877 8.7832C12.0305 8.6999 11.9998 8.60107 11.9998 8.5V4H7.99978V8.5Z" /></svg></span><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-6-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__title">Claude Science</h3></div><div class="FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__itemContent"><div class="text-rich-text FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__body"><p class="text-body-3">Collaborate on rigorous scientific research with the Claude Science app. It runs analyses, searches databases, and traces every step from data wrangling to publication, so you can spend time on science.</p></div><div role="group" class="ButtonGroup-module-scss-module__HSKYlq__buttonGroup FeatureList-module-scss-module__3G7ECW__ctas"><a href="/product/claude-science" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small text-caption" data-cta-position="featureList" data-cta-url="/product/claude-science">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="promptCards" data-section="promptCards" data-cta-section="promptCards" class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__wrapper theme-accent SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__spacingBottomLarge"><div class="SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__borderTop"></div><div data-wf-threshold="small" data-wf-width="narrow" class="container SectionWrapper-module-scss-module__NFbz_a__narrow"><div class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__introBlock IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__spacingBelowSmall" style="--intro-headline-width:30ch;--intro-text-width:45ch"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__base Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__size-large IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__pictogram" role="img" aria-label="Abstract illustration of two hands clasping or linking together, suggesting connection, partnership, collaboration, or unity. Rendered in beige and dark colors."></div><h2 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-1-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__heading IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headline IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__headlineBalance" style="--word-stagger:0.2s" aria-label="Try Claude"><span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:0" aria-hidden="true">Try</span> <span class="AnimatedHeading-module-scss-module__KoWePa__word" style="--word-index:1" aria-hidden="true">Claude</span></h2><div class="AnimatedReveal-module-scss-module__8zH9eW__container IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__subheadlineAndCtas" style="--reveal-y:10px;--reveal-duration:0.75s;--reveal-delay:0s;--reveal-stagger:0.1s"><p class="IntroBlock-module-scss-module__0mSC7a__subheadline text-body-large-2" style="--reveal-index:0">Get to know Claude by trying a few sample prompts.</p></div></div><div class="Tabs-module-scss-module__LGZaLG__wrapper Tabs-module-scss-module__LGZaLG__collapsible PromptCards-module-scss-module__HcTnea__tabs" data-cta-ignore=""><div class="Tabs-module-scss-module__LGZaLG__tabNav Tabs-module-scss-module__LGZaLG__medium" role="tablist"><span class="Tabs-module-scss-module__LGZaLG__indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span><button class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-tertiary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-small Button-module-scss