a screenshot, and triage it against our trademark enforcement playbook. Rank them by priority.\",\"oFLooU1/QL\":\"{minutes} min remaining\",\"oGju2hB9//\":\"Compliance API\",\"oJiyzDUmhQ\":\"Claude Code has dramatically accelerated our team's coding efficiency. I can now write EDA code in a notebook—pulling data, training a model, and evaluating it with basic metrics—and then ask Claude to convert that into a Metaflow pipeline. This process saves 1-2 days of routine (and often boring!) work per model.\",\"oKdO3Ime5c\":\"Build a social set for the Fall Readout using our brand guidelines. Three 4:5 posts — a stat, a headline, and a trend — as one proof sheet.\",\"oNedMwBIOc\":\"Fable included, up to half your weekly limit\",\"oNxIDnOk31\":\"Post the roll-up in-channel\",\"oUWADlOjJt\":\"No\",\"oZA/6fiLF8\":\"Partner tier\",\"ocMFdUoM0+\":\"{name} is available through the Claude Marketplace. If you have an existing Anthropic commitment, you can apply it here. Contact our team to find the right path for your organization.\",\"odMy5ERU7S\":\"Quick answers or long tasks\",\"ohjvu+C87x\":\"Active users\",\"onyxL5iLxe\":\"{count, plural, other {# more}}\",\"onz7SZxGnk\":\"Build Prototype / POC\",\"otTZisSg5A\":\"If you subscribed through the App Store or Google Play, cancel from that app under Billing \u003e Manage subscription, or directly in your \u003ca\u003eApple\u003c/a\u003e or \u003cb\u003eGoogle Play\u003c/b\u003e account.\",\"ox9wXewvNY\":\"Check the week’s meetings, next team sync Thursday\",\"p556q3uvbn\":\"Copied\",\"p64wBxVoxB\":\"Claude Code maps and explains large codebases in a few seconds. It uses agentic search to understand project structure and dependencies without you having to manually select context files.\",\"p6McXlpoIr\":\"Claude Code for every seat, with self-serve seat management and up to $500 per month in pooled API credits.\",\"p7f+VL1U+Y\":\"Swipe to see more\",\"p8Zpb+X9Sa\":\"You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro, Max, or Ultra plan, 