the controlling precedent, and draft a memo on how it applies to our matter.\",\"rTFm2huXkK\":\"What you can do\",\"rUSV9GH+x6\":\"Opt-out\",\"rbrahOGMC3\":\"Close\",\"rfycQ8j6IA\":\"Use case details\",\"riqC8uzyv1\":\"Education plan\",\"rjeRzhM7pX\":\"Research \u0026 Intelligence\",\"rnb9d/6z90\":\"View more\",\"rrYb0J+gGk\":\"Register once and we’ll send you the details for every session.\",\"rsNxxABBT7\":\"Read documentation\",\"rssHel8myN\":\"Create and edit files with code execution\",\"ruV1XSR19T\":\"Domain capture\",\"ruo+K7xIaj\":\"Admin controls for remote and local connectors\",\"rvirM238ZE\":\"Location\",\"s1njKoT8b8\":\"Expand resources canvas\",\"s6CiWwAAlT\":\"Middle East \u0026 Africa\",\"sFlniVMOTp\":\"Claude Docs\",\"sbCcyNpP/9\":\"Admins set access by team, manage spend limits, and control tool permissions by department. Activity streams to your SIEM through OpenTelemetry.\",\"sdKwU38Eo/\":\"Add the tools {category} teams use every day.\",\"sgTGYsZYPT\":\"Default tier for both piloting and scaling everyday use cases\",\"snqlu2y0xx\":\"On demand\",\"soN6WFjyyQ\":\"Features and capabilities\",\"srwgz/e2SQ\":\"Billing and payments\",\"ssfxGtVpUg\":\"There are three Meridians in the CRM — the health one has a meeting on your calendar today. Want the whole account history, or just what’s changed since the last call?\",\"stJYEYsqnV\":\"{current} of {total}\",\"sy7vzf+1SO\":\"Scheduled tasks\",\"szo1Q6XDyE\":\"Team and self-serve Enterprise: an Owner or Primary Owner cancels under \u003ca\u003eOrganization settings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"t/JCKd7Rat\":\"Sales \u0026 marketing\",\"t/QGDExlfi\":\"Asset creation\",\"t0clKd0XbN\":\"Windows (arm64)\",\"t31v0g8Oxk\":\"Separating the price beat from the volume story\",\"tF9rgXap+C\":\"Webinar\",\"tFrzx0/fBv\":\"Set up work Claude runs again on a schedule you choose.\",\"tHSb8p10Ty\":\"Desktop\",\"tI/qaSnHPB\":\"\u003cb\u003e10x Pro usage\u003c/b\u003e every week*\",\"tL5vvEz2a5\":\"What you’ll learn\",